\ `SeqInt` and `SeqBool` are how the target spells `Seq Int` and `Seq Bool`,
\ so a source type with either name is refused: otherwise a word over an
\ opaque `SeqInt` and one over `Seq Int` would compile to the same type.
: keep
  (forall ρ; ρ x:SeqInt^many -- ρ x:SeqInt^many)
  ;

: reserved-type-name ( -- ) ;
